:"[nginx-1.30.7](https://nginx.org/en/download.html) stable version has been released, with vulnerability fixes for [use-after-free](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) in resolver (CVE-2026-123634), [memory corruption](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) in HTTP/2 flow control (CVE-2026-123007), [use-after-free](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) in HTTP/3 (CVE-2026-121810), [use-after-free](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) in HTTP/2 (CVE-2026-123633), [infinite loop](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) while reading client request body over TLS 1.3 (CVE-2026-118899), [use-after-free](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) in mail proxy module (CVE-2026-113425), [buffer overflow](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) when using alias with try_files (CVE-2026-125283), [SNI bypass](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) in client certificate validation in stream module (CVE-2026-120967), and [insufficient validation](https://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html) in stream ssl_preread module (CVE-2026-123640).\r\n\r\nSee official [CHANGES](https://nginx.org/en/CHANGES) on nginx.org.\r\n\r\nBelow is a release summary generated by GitHub.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Backport of .github workflow changes by @pluknet in https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1881\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/nginx/nginx/compare/release-1.30.6...release-1.30.7","upstream_url":"https://github.com/nginx/nginx/releases/tag/release-1.30.7"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/root","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","PHP_INI_SCAN_DIR=:/config/php","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true"],"exposed_ports":["443/tcp","80/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build